# SPA fallback for BrowserRouter deep links (refresh on /flows/…).
# Rewrite to `/` — not `/index.html` (Cloudflare flags that as an infinite loop).
# `/assets/*` MUST come before the catch-all or JS/CSS are rewritten to HTML
# (white screen + MIME errors).
/api/*        /api/:splat     200
/assets/*     /assets/:splat  200
/favicon.svg  /favicon.svg    200
/*            /               200
